<title>SWITZERLAND: S&amp;P affirms SBC rating after Dillon buy.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P affirms SBC rating after Dillon buy.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poors has affirmed its ratings on Swiss Bank Corp (SBC) and units following yesterday's acquisition of U.S. bank Dillon, Read &amp; Co. for around $600 million.</p>
<p>Ratings agency S&amp;P also said in a statement that ratings of SBC Warburg Australia Ltd and SBC Warburg Australia Holdings Ltd remained on creditwatch with positive implications.</p>
<p>Senior debt of SBC is affirmed as AA+, subordinated debt at AA, commercial paper at A-1+, certificates of deposit at AA+/A-1+ and counterparty ratings at AA+/A-1+.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
